msgid "In batch mode, `DOWNLOAD` runs in a one-row bounded download batch. Multiple downloads in one batch row or streaming SQL projection share one byte budget. In streaming mode, Klein uses a bounded, order-preserving asynchronous operator so downloads do not block the task actor and a full in-flight window propagates backpressure. HTTP(S) destinations are checked before every request and redirect. By default, credentials, unknown schemes, private/non-global resolved addresses, HTTPS downgrades, excessive redirects, responses over 64 MiB, and requests past the 30-second I/O budget are rejected as SQL `NULL`."
msgstr "在批处理模式中，`DOWNLOAD` 在单行有界下载批次中运行。同一批处理行或流式 SQL 投影中的多个下载共享一个字节预算。在流式模式中，Klein 使用有界、保序的异步算子，使下载不会阻塞 task actor，并让满载的进行中窗口传播背压。每次请求和重定向之前都会检查 HTTP(S) 目标。默认情况下，凭据、未知 scheme、私有或非全局解析地址、HTTPS 降级、过多重定向、超过 64 MiB 的响应以及超出 30 秒 I/O 预算的请求都会被拒绝并产生 SQL `NULL`。"

msgid "Use the `sql.download.*` configuration group to narrow schemes and hosts, authorize explicit IP ranges, or adjust byte and time limits. A hostname allowlist does not override private-address blocking. Local development paths continue to work through plain paths, `file://`, and `local://`. The synchronous system DNS resolver cannot be interrupted by the HTTP timeout, and object-store timeouts remain controlled by their filesystem implementation."
msgstr "使用 `sql.download.*` 配置组收窄 scheme 和主机范围、授权显式 IP 段，或调整字节和时间限制。主机名允许列表不会覆盖私有地址阻止规则。本地开发路径仍可通过普通路径、`file://` 和 `local://` 使用。HTTP 超时无法中断同步系统 DNS 解析器，对象存储超时仍由其文件系统实现控制。"

msgid "Composing `DOWNLOAD` inside another scalar expression is rejected except when it is the direct data argument of a media function; using it as a predicate is also rejected. `RANDOM([seed])`, `UUID()`, and `MONOTONICALLY_INCREASING_ID()` are task-local streaming expressions and work in projections, predicates, grouping, and aggregate inputs where their SQL types are valid."
msgstr "除非 `DOWNLOAD` 是媒体函数的直接数据参数，否则不允许将其组合到另一个标量表达式中；也不允许将其用作 predicate。`RANDOM([seed])`、`UUID()` 和 `MONOTONICALLY_INCREASING_ID()` 是 task 本地的流式表达式，可在其 SQL 类型有效的投影、predicate、分组和聚合输入中使用。"

msgid "SQL `NULL` inputs produce `NULL` without invoking a decoder. Invalid media fails the task without including payload data in the error. Per-call limits bound input and output bytes, decoded pixels, PDF pages, and render DPI; the defaults are 256 MiB, 64 megapixels, 100 selected pages, and 600 DPI. One fused media batch processes one row at a time and has a 512 MiB cumulative binary-value budget."
msgstr "SQL `NULL` 输入会直接产生 `NULL`，不会调用 decoder。无效媒体会使 task 失败，错误中不包含负载数据。每次调用的限制会约束输入和输出字节、解码像素、PDF 页数及渲染 DPI；默认值分别为 256 MiB、6400 万像素、100 个选中页面和 600 DPI。单个融合媒体批次每次处理一行，并具有 512 MiB 的累计二进制值预算。"
